{"id":"n18189-2-10","stage":4,"title":"과열 · 过热","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18189-2-10-1","ko":"이 거리의 가게들은 물건값이 매우 싸네요?","zh":"这条街上的店铺，商品价格真的非常便宜啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거리의","meaning":"大街，街头，马路","explanation":"거리：大街，街头，马路；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"거리","audio":"/audio/51e49276d394c94f94a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20187","senseId":"1","lemma":"거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게들은","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물건값이","meaning":"商品，物品；价格，价钱","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；값：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"},{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"1","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸네요?","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"51e49276d394c94f","term":"거리","zh":"大街，街头，马路","audio":"/audio/51e49276d394c94f94a8.mp3","entryId":"20187","definition":"供人或车马通行的道路。","pronunciation":["거리"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"b19ddf94b4c9896b","term":"값","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3","entryId":"20178","definition":"给买卖的东西划定的货币数量。","pronunciation":["갑"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["매우"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/044b8a468aebbd4ddf29.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18189-2-10-2","ko":"그게 다 서로 손님을 모으려고 과열 경쟁을 해서 그래요.","zh":"那都是因为各家店铺为了抢顾客而过度竞争的缘故啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그게","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님을","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모으려고","meaning":"吸引，集中，聚集","explanation":"모으다：吸引，集中，聚集；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"모으다","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74137","senseId":"7","lemma":"모으다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과열","meaning":"过热，过火","explanation":"과열：过热，过火","readings":[{"term":"과열","audio":"/audio/f8daa5be5dec16032b24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18189","senseId":"2","lemma":"과열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경쟁을","meaning":"竞争","explanation":"경쟁：竞争；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"경쟁","audio":"/audio/e0d5713f07b18eba10b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25688","senseId":"1","lemma":"경쟁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"49ef044188dcd25e","term":"그것","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3","entryId":"31953","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그걷"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"fbeb53408bcf7039","term":"서로","zh":"互相，相互","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3","entryId":"66374","definition":"两个以上缔结关系的对象相对于各自的对方。","pronunciation":["서로"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"5ddf1bf1c10eabe3","term":"모으다","zh":"吸引，集中，聚集","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3","entryId":"74137","definition":"引发人们的注意力或兴趣。","pronunciation":["모으다"]},{"id":"f8daa5be5dec1603","term":"과열","zh":"过热，过火","audio":"/audio/f8daa5be5dec16032b24.mp3","entryId":"18189","definition":"程度过分或过于火热。","pronunciation":["과ː열"]},{"id":"e0d5713f07b18eba","term":"경쟁","zh":"竞争","audio":"/audio/e0d5713f07b18eba10b8.mp3","entryId":"25688","definition":"为在某个领域取胜或领先而相互较量。","pronunciation":["경ː쟁"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9c0aa567347ba82d73cb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.929,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18189","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那都是因为各家店铺为了抢顾客而过度竞争的缘故啊。","这个村子树木很多，花朵也很多，真好啊。","这条街上的店铺，商品价格真的非常便宜啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那都是因为各家店铺为了抢顾客而过度竞争的缘故啊。","这条街上的店铺，商品价格真的非常便宜啊？","这个村子树木很多，花朵也很多，真好啊。"],"answer":0}]}
